  "analyzed_vuln": {
    "function": "Visit",
    "file": "arrow/cpp/src/arrow/array/validate.cc",
    "description": "Root cause is missing null-check for dense UnionArray value offsets buffer in ValidateArrayDataVisitor::Visit(const UnionArray&). In the dense-union branch it unconditionally does `const int32_t* offsets = array.raw_value_offsets();` then reads `offsets[i]` for each non-null slot. If a malformed IPC message constructs a dense union array with length > 0 but without a valid offsets buffer, `raw_value_offsets()` is null/invalid and ValidateFull performs an out-of-bounds read (ASan at validate.cc:380).",
    "conditions": "Trigger via IPC stream fuzz input that decodes to a RecordBatch containing a DENSE UnionArray with non-null elements and inconsistent/missing offsets buffer metadata. Data flow: stream_fuzz -> ipc::internal::FuzzIpcStream -> RecordBatchStreamReader::Open/ReadNext (accepts malformed union buffers) -> RecordBatch::ValidateFull -> internal::ValidateArrayData -> ValidateArrayDataVisitor::Visit(UnionArray), where offsets are dereferenced without first validating presence/size of the offsets buffer."
  },
